# Optional private metallib corpus (mined data).
# Committed under validation/corpus/: README.md + metal2vulkan-ledger.jsonl (translate hashes).
# Execution goldens (metal/vulkan/moltenvk JSONL) may be committed for reproducibility:
# hash-identified plans, deterministic digests, and output_b64 payloads; no AIR bodies.
# Everything under local/ is user-supplied and must never be committed.
validation/corpus/local/
*.jsonl.tmp

